<title>GREECE: Members could use office terminals - Athens bourse.</title>
<headline>Members could use office terminals - Athens bourse.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Member firms of the Athens stock exchange can execute orders via terminals located in their central offices or their branches provided that the bourse has installed the necessary equipment, the bourse authorities decided today.</p>
<p>Each member will be allowed to use just one office terminal, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>The authorities specified the technical design of the terminals and their use, it said.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
